# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:15
translate italian kendra3_e6819a9b:

    # "I get in my car and start driving, not sure exactly where I'm going to go yet."
    "Salgo in macchina e inizio a guidare, senza sapere ancora esattamente dove andrò."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:16
translate italian kendra3_7762f52e:

    # "I'm kind of tired from the long day and just sort of zoning out a little."
    "Sono un po’ stanco dopo questa lunga giornata e mi sto semplicemente distrando un po’."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:19
translate italian kendra3_d0eb2e8d:

    # "When all of a sudden I spot something moving quick in my peripheral vision."
    "Quando all’improvviso intravedo qualcosa che si muove velocemente con la coda dell’occhio."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:21
translate italian kendra3_f1e9089d:

    # "I slam on the brakes but the figure still thuds against the front of the car."
    "Freno di colpo, ma la figura si schianta comunque contro il paraurti anteriore."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:22
translate italian kendra3_9ad52246:

    # "I quickly put the car in park and get out."
    "Metto subito la macchina in folle e scendo."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:26
translate italian kendra3_58b0214e:

    # "I rush to the front of the car and see Kendra lying there."
    "Mi precipito davanti alla macchina e vedo Kendra distesa lì."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:29
translate italian kendra3_d677ec43:

    # sg "OWWW!"
    sg "Ahi!"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:30
translate italian kendra3_b6b2fb95:

    # pc "You're yelling. That's a good sign."
    pc "Stai urlando. È un buon segno."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:31
translate italian kendra3_2496078f:

    # sg "What the fuck? You ran into me!"
    sg "Ma che cazzo? Mi hai investito!"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:32
translate italian kendra3_62b55de1:

    # pc "I was driving. On the road. Like people do."
    pc "Stavo guidando. Sulla strada. Come fanno tutti."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:33
translate italian kendra3_903c932a:

    # pc "You rolled out right in front of me."
    pc "Mi sei sbucata proprio davanti."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:34
translate italian kendra3_081c6b88:

    # sg "Ugh, help me up."
    sg "Uffa, aiutami ad alzarmi."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:36
translate italian kendra3_dafc27de:

    # sg "I'm skating, what the fuck are you doing?"
    sg "Sto pattinando, che cazzo stai facendo?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:37
translate italian kendra3_62b55de1_1:

    # pc "I was driving. On the road. Like people do."
    pc "Stavo guidando. Sulla strada. Come fanno tutti."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:38
translate italian kendra3_903c932a_1:

    # pc "You rolled out right in front of me."
    pc "Mi sei sbucata proprio davanti."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:39
translate italian kendra3_1353eb18:

    # sg "So, you're saying this is MY fault?"
    sg "Quindi stai dicendo che è colpa MIA?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:40
translate italian kendra3_a830423f:

    # pc "Yes!"
    pc "Sì!"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:41
translate italian kendra3_23a2710a:

    # sg "Ugh! Help me up."
    sg "Uffa! Aiutami ad alzarmi."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:43
translate italian kendra3_b5c3864a:

    # sg "Where are you going?"
    sg "Dove stai andando?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:44
translate italian kendra3_61295bf1:

    # sg "Get back here and help me up!"
    sg "Torna qui e aiutami ad alzarmi!"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:45
translate italian kendra3_067e07ea:

    # pc "Well, I guess she's not dead. That's good, I suppose."
    pc "Beh, immagino che non sia morta. È una buona cosa, suppongo."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:46
translate italian kendra3_fafb1e2e:

    # sg "You know you're talking out loud, right?"
    sg "Lo sai che stai parlando ad alta voce, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:49
translate italian kendra3_9f290cbc:

    # "I reach down and help her up off the ground. She has a couple of scrapes, but otherwise looks okay."
    "Mi chino e la aiuto ad alzarsi da terra. Ha un paio di graffi, ma per il resto sembra stare bene."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:50
translate italian kendra3_615399f4:

    # sg "Ow, ow, OWWWW!"
    sg "Ahi, ahi, AHI!"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:51
translate italian kendra3_fa75bbc3:

    # pc "Are you okay?"
    pc "Stai bene?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:52
translate italian kendra3_45a6e9be:

    # sg "Oh I'm peachy, except for being hit with a fucking car."
    sg "Oh, sto benissimo, a parte il fatto di essere stata investita da una fottuta macchina."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:53
translate italian kendra3_117925e8:

    # pc "I really tried to stop. You just came out of nowhere."
    pc "Ho davvero cercato di fermarmi. Sei spuntata fuori dal nulla."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:54
translate italian kendra3_74d101ab:

    # sg "I must have been daydreaming again. I do that sometimes when I'm skating."
    sg "Devo aver fantasticato di nuovo. A volte mi capita quando pattino."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:55
translate italian kendra3_86c00ccd:

    # sg "I don't even know where I am right now. What the fuck are these apartments?"
    sg "Non so nemmeno dove mi trovo in questo momento. Che cazzo sono questi appartamenti?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:56
translate italian kendra3_02dfe69f:

    # sg "Where the fuck's my board?"
    sg "Dove cazzo è il mio skateboard?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:59
translate italian kendra3_798e7f93:

    # sg "Oh no."
    sg "Oh no."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:60
translate italian kendra3_aafa9da5:

    # "Her board is snapped clean in half, partially under my front tires."
    "Il suo skateboard è spezzato nettamente a metà, in parte sotto le mie ruote anteriori."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:61
translate italian kendra3_3092625b:

    # sg "Oh no! Keven!"
    sg "Oh no! Keven!"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:62
translate italian kendra3_48a2dfa9:

    # pc "Keven? My name is [pcname]."
    pc "Keven? Mi chiamo [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:63
translate italian kendra3_2a40904c:

    # sg "Not you. My deck. I named it Keven after the first guy I rode in Junior High."
    sg "Non tu. La mia tavola. L’ho chiamata Keven in onore del primo ragazzo con cui sono uscita alle medie."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:64
translate italian kendra3_bf28e1a1:

    # pc "Oh."
    pc "Oh."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:65
translate italian kendra3_99e26f36:

    # sg "Why God? Why did you do this?"
    sg "Perché, Dio? Perché l’hai fatto?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:70
translate italian kendra3_a38c3d5a:

    # sg "WHY!?"
    sg "PERCHÉ!?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:73
translate italian kendra3_62aa0256:

    # "A few minutes later, I get her into my car, the broken board, Keven, in her lap."
    "Qualche minuto dopo, la faccio salire in macchina con la tavola rotta, Keven, sulle sue ginocchia."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:77
translate italian kendra3_8e62d7f2:

    # sg "This sucks."
    sg "Che schifo."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:78
translate italian kendra3_12117716:

    # pc "I'm sorry. Is it real expensive?"
    pc "Mi dispiace. Costa davvero tanto?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:79
translate italian kendra3_0a31c2a5:

    # sg "Expensive enough that I'm not going to be able to afford it for a while."
    sg "Abbastanza da non potermi permettere di comprarla per un po’."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:80
translate italian kendra3_63694087:

    # sg "I don't have any money."
    sg "Non ho soldi."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:81
translate italian kendra3_ed6ef899:

    # pc "What kind is it? Maybe I can keep an eye out for it."
    pc "Che modello è? Magari posso tenermi d’occhio se ne vedo una in giro."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:82
translate italian kendra3_84536790:

    # sg "It's a Maria Kruz. Top of the line."
    sg "È una Maria Kruz. Il top di gamma."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:83
translate italian kendra3_01ef4db4:

    # pc "How much are they?"
    pc "Quanto costano?"

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:84
translate italian kendra3_ac6e3d6f:

    # sg "I don't fucking know. My Dad bought Keven for me when I was twelve years old. I haven't ever had to buy another."
    sg "Non ne ho la più pallida idea, cazzo. Mio padre mi ha comprato una Keven quando avevo dodici anni. Non ho mai dovuto comprarne un’altra."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:85
translate italian kendra3_7ae9cf5e:

    # pc "That's a long time."
    pc "È passato un bel po’ di tempo."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:88
translate italian kendra3_3f13132b:

    # sg "Yeah."
    sg "Sì."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:89
translate italian kendra3_a1d21d3d:

    # sg "Anyway, just drop me off here at the park."
    sg "Comunque, lasciami qui al parco."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:90
translate italian kendra3_36d7a2b5:

    # sg "I want to be alone for a while."
    sg "Voglio stare un po’ da sola."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:91
translate italian kendra3_63023601:

    # pc "Okay."
    pc "Ok."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:92
translate italian kendra3_ed6d9d2d:

    # pc "I'm really sorry about your board."
    pc "Mi dispiace davvero per la tua tavola."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:93
translate italian kendra3_3f13132b_1:

    # sg "Yeah."
    sg "Sì."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:94
translate italian kendra3_0fcd3eab:

    # sg "All right, see you later."
    sg "Va bene, ci vediamo più tardi."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:96
translate italian kendra3_6de3adac:

    # "She gets out of my car and walks away towards the skate park, her head hanging low."
    "Lei scende dalla mia auto e si allontana a piedi verso lo skate park, con la testa china."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:99
translate italian kendra3_abb54c8d:

    # "I feel really bad for her. I mean, it wasn't really my fault, but still."
    "Mi dispiace davvero tanto per lei. Insomma, non è stata proprio colpa mia, ma comunque."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:100
translate italian kendra3_48ac3316:

    # "Maybe I can get her a new board? I don't think there's a place in town that sells them, but I can check the internet."
    "Magari potrei comprarle una nuova tavola? Non credo che in città ci sia un negozio che le venda, ma posso dare un'occhiata su Internet."

# game/Scenes/Kendra/kendra3.rpy:101
translate italian kendra3_91fb525a:

    # "I should get on the laptop in my bedroom and see if I can find anything."
    "Dovrei accendere il portatile in camera mia e vedere se riesco a trovare qualcosa."

